  "description": {
   "en": "A sequel to the dance comic classic Dancing Generation. Aiko returns to New York from her dance studies in Europe and suddenly finds herself understudying the lead dancer. The performance is well received, but her boyfriend Shin, who belonged to the same dance troupe, is missing. In addition, Aiko begins to feel uncomfortable with the feeling of being “made to dance” under the control of Kanzaki, the leader of the troupe. Aiko is expelled from the dance company for interrupting a performance..."
